From 93902d568a6c6e73288b54d25990d01232bcf07f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AzediZ <145237384+AzediZ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:37:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Incursions: first playable cut (Vanguard sites, influence,
 CONCORD payouts)

New IncursionMgr singleton (system/cosmicMgrs/IncursionMgr, IncursionDB), ticked
from EntityList's 1Hz block. An incursion covers a constellation: a staging
system (station, border preferred) that is also a vanguard system, the two
nearest systems as vanguard, the farthest as headquarters, the rest assault.
State, influence and systems persist in incIncursions/incSystems.

Vanguard sites are built from incSiteTypes/incSiteObjects: a Cosmic Anomaly
beacon registered with AnomalyMgr::RegisterAnomaly() (scanner, warp-to and
sysSignatures for bookmarks), wave-0 structures, then NPC waves. Site NPCs are
plain NPCs with no SpawnMgr; the manager polls GetSE() for each and spawns the
next wave when the current one is gone. The site bubble is flagged incursion so
the Sansha don't warp off. Clearing the last wave pays each pilot in the beacon's
bubble ISK (RewardManager journal type, from CONCORD) and CONCORD LP, scaled by
ships spawned versus design size and split over pilots, capped at the full-fleet
share; influence drops by the site's percentage and the system gets a
SiteRespawn cooldown. Vanguard systems are kept at SitesPerSystem live sites while
loaded. Influence regenerates after RegenDelay; zero influence or Lifetime moves
to Withdrawing, which ends the incursion after WithdrawTime. AutoStart keeps
MaxActive incursions running. FleetSize scales wave sizes (random rounding, never
an empty wave); Strength scales HP, booster amount and turret damage, and missile
rate of fire.

Site items use customInfo 'livedungeon_incursion': DBCleaner already removes
these on boot, and ManagerDB::ClearDungeons(systemID) now also removes
'livedungeon%' items when a system unloads, so saved copies don't reload as
orphans. SystemManager::UnloadSystem() tells the manager to drop its records.

Migration 20261012120000-incursions: stand-in dgmTypeAttributes for 25 Sansha
incursion types (shipped data has none; values derived from True Sansha and
Guristas NPCs, not CCP's), Sansha wrecks in invTypesToWrecks, the incursion
tables, and three Vanguard sites (approximate layouts and rewards).

New <incursion> config section with defaults in the constructor. New ADMIN
command /incursion start|end|info|influence. NPCAIMgr::AttackTarget() skips NPCs
with no turret damage instead of sending a zero-damage laser effect. Fixes a
duplicate enum name in EVE_Incursion.h, which had never been included.

Not done: Sansha EWAR, assault/HQ sites, mothership, system penalty beacons,
end-of-incursion LP, client UI (journal, starmap).
